# Data Flow Diagram (DFD) Analysis

This document outlines how information moves through the **Fean Pet Shop** system, from initial user interaction to database updates and final order fulfillment.

## 1. Context Diagram (Level 0)
The Context Diagram shows the system as a single process and its interactions with external entities.

```mermaid
graph LR
    U[User / Customer] -- Registration / Login --> S(Fean Pet Shop System)
    U -- Product Search --> S
    U -- Cart & Order Request --> S
    S -- Order Confirmation --> U
    S -- Search Results / Product List --> U

    A[Admin] -- Inventory Updates --> S
    A -- User Management --> S
    S -- Order Alerts / Sales Stats --> A

    P[Payment Gateway / UPI] -- Payment Token/Success --> S
    S -- Transaction Details --> P
```

---

## 2. Level 1 DFD: Functional Decomposition
The Level 1 diagram breaks the system down into core processes and data stores.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% Entities
    User((User/Customer))
    Admin((Administrator))

    %% Processes
    P1[1.0 Auth & Profile Management]
    P2[2.0 Product & Search Engine]
    P3[3.0 Cart & Order Processing]
    P4[4.0 Admin Dashboard & Analytics]
    P5[5.0 Communication & Feedback]

    %% Data Stores
    D1[(Users Collection)]
    D2[(Products Collection)]
    D3[(Orders & Payments)]
    D4[(Ratings & Contacts)]

    %% Connections
    User -->|Credentials| P1
    P1 <-->|Read/Write User Data| D1
    
    User -->|Search Queries| P2
    P2 <-->|Fetch Products| D2
    
    User -->|Checkout Details| P3
    P3 <-->|Update Stock / Save Order| D2 & D3
    
    Admin -->|Manage Inventory| P4
    P4 <-->|Update Collections| D2 & D1
    
    User -->|Ratings / Messages| P5
    P5 <-->|Save Feedback| D4
```

---

## 3. Data Flow Descriptions

| Flow Name | Source | Destination | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Search Query** | User | Product Engine | Keywords, filters, and categories. |
| **Product Data** | Database | User UI | Product names, prices, pet breeds, and images. |
| **Order Request** | Cart | Order Process | List of items, quantities, and delivery address. |
| **Inventory Update**| Admin | Product DB | New stock levels, price changes, or animal availability. |
| **Payment Status** | Payment System| Order Process | Confirmation of successful transaction. |

---

